<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets Bk of East Asia warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets Bk of East Asia warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Thursday it has issued 200 million American-style call warrants on shares of Bank of East Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$34.70	  PREMIUM	  13.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.47886	GEARING	  7.25X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  05.DEC.97	 PAYDATE	  23.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   27.DEC.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$34.70	  MIN EXER LOT   2,000</p>
<p>NOTES: CASH SETTLEMENT OF EXERCISE AMOUNT PAYABLE IN HONG KONG DOLLARS OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
